{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Calculate scores based on tile patterns and bonuses after each winning hand, using &quot;Blood River&quot; rules. Play until reaching the target score or exhausting draw attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong><br>After clearing Chengdu, unlock another city. Conquer each city to gradually illuminate the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Mahjong rules\u2014only winning hands score. Rogue-like mechanics ensure unique runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 100 global cities, each with distinct rules and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulty clears expand a city's influence zone, allowing free unlocks within it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade characters with unique skills to test your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip artifacts to enhance characters' power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach effects to individual tiles for deeper customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade tile patterns to boost their potency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned Updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New character designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New artifact designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New city mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenge tile decks</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear Difficulty 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3641990/e0466a3e196e3f26e09318d0a6fa3d86e8c0793f.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Difficulty 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3641990/0b6ae8ca83fa98501549d3b0894f2d1d51777a96.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Difficulty 3",